<%- contentFor('body') %>

<main class="policy-page">
    <div class="policy-container">
        <header class="policy-header">
            <span class="policy-badge">Compliance & IT Act, 2000</span>
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="policy-updated">Last Updated: November 2026 | Effective Date: November 2026</p>
        </header>

        <article class="policy-body">
            <p><strong>ROINAX Global</strong> ("we," "our," or "us") operates the website <code>roinax.onrender.com</code>. We are committed to safeguarding the privacy and personal credentials of CSP kiosks, banking correspondents, retail vendors, and individual purchasers using our enterprise hardware procurement and business management platform.</p>

            <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>When you register an account, browse products, or purchase banking hardware, we collect necessary operational details, including:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Identity Details:</strong> Full Name, Enterprise/Firm Name, Date of Birth, and Gender.</li>
                <li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> Active Gmail/Email address and 10-digit delivery mobile number.</li>
                <li><strong>Shipping & Billing Destination:</strong> Complete physical address, Landmark, City, State, PIN code, and optional GSTIN.</li>
                <li><strong>Technical & Session Data:</strong> IP address, device fingerprints, browser cookies, and encrypted session tokens managed via our database session store.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>2. Payment Gateway Security (No Raw Card Storage)</h2>
            <div class="policy-callout">
                All digital transactions are processed securely via <strong>Razorpay Software Private Limited</strong>. ROINAX Global never captures, records, or stores raw credit/debit card numbers, CVVs, net-banking passwords, or UPI MPINs on our servers.
            </div>
            <p>Razorpay operates as an authorized Payment Aggregator under Reserve Bank of India (RBI) guidelines, utilizing PCI-DSS Level 1 compliance and 256-bit SSL encryption. All transaction verifications on our backend use constant-time cryptographic HMAC SHA-256 signature verification.</p>

            <h2>3. How We Use Collected Data</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>To generate verifiable purchase orders and itemized invoices.</li>
                <li>To dispatch automated transaction receipts and shipping updates via the Google Gmail API.</li>
                <li>To route physical biometric hardware, thermal printers, and branch banners through third-party courier services.</li>
                <li>To provision cloud whitelisting and annual licenses with UIDAI-certified RD service portals.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>4. Data Sharing & Third Parties</h2>
            <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal or business data. We only share information with:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Payment Processors:</strong> Razorpay for authorization, fraud prevention, and dispute resolution.</li>
                <li><strong>Logistics Partners:</strong> Reliable registered courier partners (e.g., Delhivery, Blue Dart, India Post) strictly to fulfill hardware dispatch.</li>
                <li><strong>Statutory Authorities:</strong> When required by Indian law, court order, or governmental audit.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>5. Contact & Data Grievance</h2>
            <p>For data rectification, account removal, or privacy inquiries, contact our Data Grievance Desk:</p>
            <div class="contact-card">
                <strong>ROINAX Global Desk</strong><br>
                Email: <code>roinaxglobal@gmail.com</code><br>
                Phone: +91 7318692999<br>
                Operating Hours: Monday – Saturday (10:00 AM – 6:00 PM IST)
            </div>
        </article>
    </div>
</main>